#: src/features/settings/connected-apps/AssistantPage.tsx
msgid "A client that cannot sign in can send an API key as <0>Authorization: Bearer</0>. Make one in <1>API keys</1>."
msgstr "ಸೈನ್ ಇನ್ ಮಾಡಲಾಗದ ಕ್ಲೈಂಟ್ API ಕೀಲಿಯನ್ನು <0>Authorization: Bearer</0> ಆಗಿ ಕಳುಹಿಸಬಹುದು. <1>API ಕೀಲಿಗಳು</1> ನಲ್ಲಿ ಒಂದನ್ನು ರಚಿಸಿ."

#: src/features/migrations/text.ts
msgid "A Conditional Access policy of your Microsoft 365 organization does not allow this sign-in. Ask your admin to allow it, or upload an export file of the mailbox instead."
