#: src/features/migrations/MigrationsPage.tsx
msgid "Moving from Gmail, Google Workspace, Yandex, iCloud, Zoho, Yahoo, Fastmail, GMX or any IMAP server? Yuva copies the mailbox's history into an inbox, quietly and newest first, while your team keeps working. Then you forward the mailbox here and nothing is lost in between."
